<title>FRANCE: BNP gets full Thai licence.</title>
<headline>BNP gets full Thai licence.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banque Nationale de Paris (BNP) said on Monday it had on a full operating licence which would allow it to set up a subsidiary in Thailand.</p>
<p>It said in a statement it was the first French bank to get such a licence and had until now been relying on an off-shore licence.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
